[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4898347090","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120970#issuecomment-4898347090","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120970","id":4898347090,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABI_bYUg","user":{"login":"QbieShay","id":7917475,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc5MTc0NzU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7917475?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay","html_url":"https://github.com/QbieShay","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-06T22:55:32Z","updated_at":"2026-07-06T22:55:32Z","body":"I'm a bit concerned with the performance implications. Is there a maximum of previews for the shader? What happens as the preview lines grow in number? How much slower is it? I'm afraid it can become unusable for big shaders.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4898347090/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4898458890","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120970#issuecomment-4898458890","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120970","id":4898458890,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABI_iNCg","user":{"login":"Nolkaloid","id":30960698,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwOTYwNjk4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30960698?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nolkaloid","html_url":"https://github.com/Nolkaloid","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nolkaloid/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nolkaloid/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nolkaloid/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nolkaloid/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nolkaloid/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nolkaloid/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nolkaloid/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nolkaloid/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nolkaloid/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-06T23:14:09Z","updated_at":"2026-07-07T13:48:41Z","body":"As per the results I got with the linked test script, changing 10 vec3 uniforms 20 times takes roughly 2485 microseconds. One could extrapolate this and say that it's acceptable. But I'll try to do some practical tests later this week.\n\nIf it's really a concern the auto-sync could be made opt-in using a checkbox.\n\n\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4898458890/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4908835074","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120970#issuecomment-4908835074","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120970","id":4908835074,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABJJbhAg","user":{"login":"Nolkaloid","id":30960698,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwOTYwNjk4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30960698?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nolkaloid","html_url":"https://github.com/Nolkaloid","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nolkaloid/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nolkaloid/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nolkaloid/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nolkaloid/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nolkaloid/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nolkaloid/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nolkaloid/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nolkaloid/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nolkaloid/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-07T21:01:55Z","updated_at":"2026-07-07T21:01:55Z","body":"@QbieShay I did some practical tests and I did not notice any significant performance impact **related to the automatic synchronization** of the shader parameters. \r\n\r\n**However** it goes without saying that the more previews you have and the more the shader is complex, the slower it is to regenerate the previews shaders. But that was already the case, before this PR.\r\n\r\nFor example, in this test scene: [perfomance_test.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/29766496/perfomance_test.zip), when enabling a preview for every line of the fragment shader, my editor freezes for a  split second when recompiling the preview shaders. Which happens when adding a new preview or after editing the shader code.  Modifying the parameters of the shader material on the other-hand, does **not** produce any _noticeable_ slowdown, at least in my tests.\r\n\r\n> Spec for reference:\r\n> Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1050 (nvidia; 580.173.02) - Intel(R) Core(TM) i5-7400 CPU @ 3.00GHz (4 threads)","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4908835074/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5470097045","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120970#issuecomment-5470097045","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120970","id":5470097045,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABRgsOlQ","user":{"login":"QbieShay","id":7917475,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc5MTc0NzU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7917475?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay","html_url":"https://github.com/QbieShay","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-30T17:10:02Z","updated_at":"2026-08-30T17:10:02Z","body":"CC @Chaosus ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5470097045/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_a